1
00:00:00,505 --> 00:00:01,935
(Leonard:)No, that can't be right.

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:06,340
(Howard:)Maybe Thor's Hammer
is a new color of nail polish.

3
00:00:07,879 --> 00:00:09,309
Then Red Hulk must be worthy!

4
00:00:09,514 --> 00:00:11,314
(Penny(off):)How could Red Hulk be worthy?

5
00:00:11,516 --> 00:00:13,486
(Bernadette(off):)You don't know his life.

6
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:21,716
There's only one logical explanation:
Somewhere in the desert...

7
00:00:21,959 --> 00:00:24,389
(Sheldon:)...we crossed into
an alternate dimension...

8
00:00:24,862 --> 00:00:28,692
(Sheldon:)...where the women in our lives
can finally appreciate great literature.

9
00:00:30,968 --> 00:00:33,168
(Raj:)If it's an alternate dimension...

10
00:00:33,371 --> 00:00:35,701
...that sounds like ajob
for a landing party.

11
00:00:40,378 --> 00:00:42,538
(Sheldon:)Captain, what are your orders?

12
00:00:44,115 --> 00:00:46,085
(Leonard:)I say we investigate.

13
00:00:49,253 --> 00:00:50,343
(GPS:)Wait.

14
00:00:52,924 --> 00:00:54,514
(Sheldon:)They might be hostile.

15
00:00:57,195 --> 00:00:59,025
(Leonard:)Fine, but set them to stun.

16
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:02,690
(Leonard:)If we vaporize Penny, I'll never
find a girlfriend that pretty again.

17
00:01:14,312 --> 00:01:18,042
(GPS:)President Eisenhower
signed the Federal Aid Highway Act...

18
00:01:18,249 --> 00:01:20,479
(GPS:)...from his hospital room.

19
00:01:20,985 --> 00:01:23,615
(First Car Thief:)Wow, that is interesting.

20
00:01:25,156 --> 00:01:26,986
(Second Car Thief:)You learn something new every day.

21
00:01:28,392 --> 00:01:34,492
Say, can you name the four state capitals
that are not served by the Interstate System?

22
00:01:34,665 --> 00:01:37,865
- Ooh, another quiz?
- Yes!

